<mxCell id="k1_c24" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;── associação com FK na BD (Flyway) &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#777777'&gt;- - -&lt;/span&gt; referência lógica (coluna UUID sem FK)&lt;br&gt;◆── composição JPA (@OneToMany cascade / @Embedded) &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#d6b656'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; «enumeration» &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#9673a6'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; «embeddable» &amp;nbsp; &lt;span style='color:#999999'&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; classe definida na outra página&lt;br&gt;Todas as entidades têm &lt;b&gt;tenantId → Tenant&lt;/b&gt; (FK tenant_id) — omitido das linhas para legibilidade. Campos-chave apenas (ids, dinheiro, estado, versão)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="900" width="1100" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="k1_c25" value="&lt;b&gt;Notas&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Visibilidade: produto criado PENDING; só ACTIVE aparece na pesquisa (approve()).&lt;br&gt;• Moderação de preço: Sku.pendingPrice aguarda OPS/ADMIN (PriceModerationService).&lt;br&gt;• Âmbito do comerciante resolve-se por merchant_users (MerchantScopeGuard).&lt;br&gt;• Promotion.scope ↔ target*: CHECK na BD (V030)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="900" width="640" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram id="k2" name="Encomenda, Pagamento &amp; Entrega"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="k2_c1" value="Pede Aqui — Modelo de domínio (2/2): Carrinho, Encomenda, Pagamento, Entrega e Dispatch" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1600" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
